  "notes": [
    "Trace 1: bus-session-populator MUST precede memory-awareness — ordering is load-bearing for WS-2 B.3b/B.4a intent-bias. 13 serialized spawns cause 22-32s worst-case wall latency (D6a-01). 24.6% of recall rows are synthetic <task-notification> XML blobs (D2c-01).",
    "Trace 2: t2_err dashed edge shows the FAILED_APPROACH auto-capture pipeline is a ghost — every subagent error goes unrecorded in archival_memory because agent-error-capture registered under 'Agent' matcher while tool emits 'Task' (D10c-02).",
    "Trace 3: nodes t3_diag / t3_audit / t3_build are all gap — they represent a manual cliff after the automated PostToolUse chain. CLAUDE.md asserts post-edit-diagnostics fires automatically on .ts edits; it was built but never registered in settings.json.",
    "Trace 4: t4_absent (SubagentStop ABSENT, gap) is the final step because proposed_bus_updates from codegraph are computed and dropped on every call — the 'downstream SubagentStop writer' the boundary rule asserts in present tense does not exist anywhere in hooks/src (D1A-001, D10c-01)."
  ]
